"text": "We joins the end of the text."
},
{
"block": "b1",
"t": 5.394,
"end": 12.116,
"text": "The input is now 101 tokens, and the pass runs again, for token number two."
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 12.866,
"end": 15.792,
"text": "Does the model redo all 101 columns?"
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 16.349,
"end": 20.517,
"text": "No. A position only looks back, never forward."
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 21.074,
"end": 25.916,
"text": "So adding We changes nothing in the 100 columns before it."
},
{
"block": "b3",
"t": 26.666,
"end": 35.397,
"text": "Their keys and values, in all 24 blocks, are already computed, so the model keeps them: the KV cache."
},
{
"block": "b3",
"t": 35.954,
"end": 39.309,
"text": "256 numbers per position, per block."
},
{
"block": "b3",
"t": 39.867,
"end": 44.035,
"text": "614,400 for Emma's prompt."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 44.785,
"end": 50.229,
"text": "So each new token needs just one new column, climbing the 24 blocks."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 50.729,
"end": 60.157,
"text": "But in every block, its query still reads the keys and values of all 101 positions, its own included."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 60.907,
"end": 63.994,
"text": "Out comes currently, at 48 percent."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 64.494,
"end": 68.731,
"text": "Its keys and values join the cache, and the next column climbs."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 69.231,
"end": 73.539,
"text": "Have: 80 percent. A space: 52."
},
{
"block": "b6",
"t": 74.289,
"end": 78.503,
"text": "Then the number. The first digit is one, at just 34 percent."
},
{
"block": "b6",
"t": 79.003,
"end": 85.039,
"text": "Two had 21. Look inside: blocks 21 and 22 lean to four."
},
{
"block": "b6",
"t": 85.539,
"end": 90.135,
"text": "Block 23 says five. Only block 24 settles on one."
},
{
"block": "b6",
"t": 90.635,
"end": 95.465,
"text": "Then zero, 32 percent. And zero, 54."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 96.215,
"end": 101.137,
"text": "City. E-bike. Battery packs. Available in our Manchester stores."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 101.637,
"end": 106.64,
"text": "A full stop. Then a special token, im_end, at 84 percent."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 107.14,
"end": 111.772,
"text": "It means: stop. Twenty tokens, twenty passes."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 112.522,
"end": 117.154,
"text": "Sample five more runs at temperature 0.7, and the bets land differently."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 117.654,
"end": 123.424,
"text": "300. 150. Over 1,000. 50. 15."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 123.981,
"end": 127.522,
"text": "Ledgerline says 5,400."
},
{
"block": "b9",
"t": 128.272,
"end": 133.647,
"text": "Every token was a bet, made by the same machine, run once per token."
},
{
"block": "b9",
